      "writtenOn": "2026-06-24T06:36:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "normally is 8, 10 and 12, more of 8. We were focussing on adding monochrome format in android media codecs when this dependency came while executing CTS.\n\nI believe codecs cannot produce YUV 400 as SkYUV metadata today",
      "parentUuid": "aa1e8c89_a11844e3",
      "range": {
